                                                "sense_id": "9e50948f-20a6-39f4-b3f0-d8cfbfc71cb8",
                                                "text": "There was no reason to pull off the interstate and drive twenty miles down a bumpy local road, just to stay in a dilapidated no-tell motel."
                                            },
